<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβᾰρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weigh down, overload</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπονέω</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				21.1
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>impose a burden on</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				12.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὴν Ἰταλίαν ἐσφοραῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.67
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθληταὶ -βαροῦσι τοὺς τεχνίτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cleom.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν -βαρούντων τὸ σῶμα
			καμάτων</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				207
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be overborne, crushed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβαρεῖσθαι τῇ μάχῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.33.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὅλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					18.21.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς λειτουργίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					487.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; also, <i>to be outweighed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ συμφέροντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.22.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
